OL,3,GNEWSACancer teen helps others find stem
OL,4,Acell donors
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage cancer patient who inspired
OL,7,Fhundreds of people to join the stem
OL,8,Fcell register is one of the finalists
OL,9,Ffor a BBC Make a Difference young hero
OL,10,Faward.
OL,12,FLeo Sproson, from Bromsgrove,
OL,13,FWorcestershire, received a transplant
OL,14,Fto treat his leukaemia earlier this
OL,15,Fyear, and by raising awareness of the
OL,16,Fneed for donors, five other people also
OL,17,Ffound matches.
OL,19,F"That's five peoples lives I could have
OL,20,Fsaved," said the 17-year old. "It just
OL,21,Fkind of feels like what I went through,
OL,22,Fmight be slightly worth it."
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
